id: merged-tuffle-mark
name: Merged Tuffle
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Merged Tuffle (1)'s, the Fused Characters' Apparel forgone as the Encounter began - gone with it
# (fusion-traits.mjs mergedTuffleForgo; combat.mjs endEncounterFor).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Merged Tuffle: the Fused Characters' Apparel forgone - Combat Rolls and Damage Reduction 2(bT) higher.
text: >
  Merged Tuffle (1): Instead of gaining the Fused Character's Apparel, you may choose to forgo it to increase your Combat Rolls and Damage Reduction by 2(bT).

---

[passive]
combatRolls += 2(bT);
damageReduction += 2(bT);
